        turn-based arcade
   1) classic - walls end a life
   2) endless - edges wrap around
   3) sprint  - two cells per move
   4) maze    - dodge the obstacles
   q) quit
  best: classic 0  endless 0  sprint 0  maze 0
  seed 355 (run with a number argument to change it)
  pick a mode:
controls: w=up s=down a=left d=right  q=end game
type a line of moves, then enter: dddww walks, 5d repeats,
a blank line steps ahead once
board: @ head  o body  * food +10  $ gold +50  ~ shrink  # wall
